  [1m3. Redaction — the load-bearing invariant[0m

  [38;5;153mredact()[39m runs [1min the core, before any sink sees the record[0m. No sink can receive an unredacted record; a future remote
  sink inherits the guarantee rather than reimplementing it. It walks [38;5;153mfields[39m recursively, replacing values whose key
  matches [38;5;153m/pass|secret|token|auth|credential|cookie|api[_-]?key/i[39m with [38;5;153m"[redacted]"[39m. Cycle-safe via [38;5;153mWeakSet[39m, with a
  depth cap so a pathological object can't hang the app.

